					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					693a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑπὸ γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ap.</u>
					18b
